      "header": {}
    },
    "blocks": [
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Spring provides comprehensive support for annotation-based configuration, operating on metadata in the component class itself by using annotations on the relevant class, method, or field declaration. As mentioned in "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Example: The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "AutowiredAnnotationBeanPostProcessor"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              }
            ],
            "kind": "xref",
            "target": "core/beans/factory-extension.html#beans-factory-extension-bpp-examples-aabpp"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", Spring uses "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "BeanPostProcessors"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " in conjunction with annotations to make the core IOC container aware of specific annotations."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "For example, the "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "@Autowired"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              }
            ],
            "kind": "xref",
            "target": "core/beans/annotation-config/autowired.html"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " annotation provides the same capabilities as described in "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Autowiring Collaborators"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "xref",
            "target": "core/beans/dependencies/factory-autowire.html"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " but with more fine-grained control and wider applicability. In addition, Spring provides support for JSR-250 annotations, such as "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "@PostConstruct"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " and "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "@PreDestroy"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", as well as support for JSR-330 (Dependency Injection for Java) annotations contained in the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "jakarta.inject"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " package such as "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "@Inject"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " and "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "@Named"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ". Details about those annotations can be found in the "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "relevant section"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "xref",
            "target": "core/beans/standard-annotations.html"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Annotation injection is performed before external property injection. Thus, external configuration (for example, XML-specified bean properties) effectively overrides the annotations for properties when wired through mixed approaches."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "admonition",
        "id": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null,
        "type": "note"
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Technically, you can register the post-processors as individual bean definitions, but they are implicitly registered in an "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "AnnotationConfigApplicationContext"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " already."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "In an XML-based Spring setup, you may include the following configuration tag to enable mixing and matching with annotation-based configuration:"
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "listing",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<beans xmlns=\"http://www.springframework.org/schema/beans\"\n\txmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\"\n\txmlns:context=\"http://www.springframework.org/schema/context\"\n\txsi:schemaLocation=\"http://www.springframework.org/schema/beans\n\t\thttps://www.springframework.org/schema/beans/spring-beans.xsd\n\t\thttp://www.springframework.org/schema/context\n\t\thttps://www.springframework.org/schema/context/spring-context.xsd\">\n\n\t<context:annotation-config/>\n\n</beans>"
          }
        ],
        "language": "xml",
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "The "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "<context:annotation-config/>"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " element implicitly registers the following post-processors:"
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "ulist",
        "id": null,
        "items": [
          {
            "blocks": [],
            "checkbox": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "ConfigurationClassPostProcessor"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/6.2.0/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ConfigurationClassPostProcessor.html"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [],
            "checkbox": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "AutowiredAnnotationBeanPostProcessor"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/6.2.0/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/AutowiredAnnotationBeanPostProcessor.html"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [],
            "checkbox": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "CommonAnnotationBeanPostProcessor"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/6.2.0/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/CommonAnnotationBeanPostProcessor.html"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [],
            "checkbox": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "PersistenceAnnotationBeanPostProcessor"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/6.2.0/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/support/PersistenceAnnotationBeanPostProcessor.html"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [],
            "checkbox": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "EventListenerMethodProcessor"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/6.2.0/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/event/EventListenerMethodProcessor.html"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "style": null,
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "<context:annotation-config/>"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " only looks for annotations on beans in the same application context in which it is defined. This means that, if you put "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "<context:annotation-config/>"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " in a "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "WebApplicationContext"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " for a "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "DispatcherServlet"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", it only checks for "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "@Autowired"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " beans in your controllers, and not your services. See "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "The DispatcherServlet"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "web/webmvc/mvc-servlet.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " for more information."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "admonition",
        "id": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null,
        "type": "note"
      }
    ],
    "outline": null,
    "title": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "value": "Annotation-based Container Configuration"
      }
    ]
  }
}
